  "title": "Semyonych",
  "kind": "joke",
  "v": 2,
  "location": "derevnya",
  "place": "farm",
  "cast": [
    "paren",
    "muzhik-ryzhy"
  ],
  "roles": {
    "paren": "driver",
    "muzhik-ryzhy": "farmer"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "On a pig farm, a young tractor driver backed up clumsily, and his huge manure trailer freaking tipped over.",
      "uncensored": "On a pig farm, a young tractor driver backed up clumsily, and his huge manure trailer fucking tipped over.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "The lad panics.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "What the heck are you worrying about, let's have a smoke over it and think it through...",
      "uncensored": "What the fuck are you worrying about, let's have a smoke over it and think it through...",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "paren",
      "text": "No time, Semyonych is gonna chew me out.",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "Oh, come on, light up.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "They light up.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "That's how it goes... You'll be messing around with this for half a day now...",
      "uncensored": "That's how it goes... You'll be fucking around with this for half a day now...",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "We should go get some grub, or else, look, you'll miss lunch over this crap.",
      "uncensored": "We should go get some grub, or else, look, you'll miss lunch over this shit.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l9",
      "character": "paren",
      "text": "I can't, I've got to hurry, or Semyonych will get mad.",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "They go and eat their fill.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "Well, let's knock back a little one...",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "character": "paren",
      "text": "I really can't, Semyonych will find out and start yelling.",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l13",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "Bullcrap, don't wet your pants, you'll get it all done.",
      "uncensored": "Bullshit, don't piss your pants, you'll get it all done.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l14",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "They pour and drink.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l15",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "Now a beer on top would make it just right...",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l16",
      "character": "paren",
      "text": "I'd better go, I'm afraid Semyonych will go totally ape.",
      "uncensored": "I'd better go, I'm afraid Semyonych will go totally apeshit.",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l17",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "So where is this Semyonych of yours?",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "l18",
      "character": "paren",
      "text": "Back there, he got pinned under the trailer.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
